 "faq1_q": "How does Elo ranking work?",
 "faq1_a": "Your Elo increases when you win matches against opponents with similar or higher ranking. Losing to lower-ranked teams will decrease it more significantly.",
 "faq2_q": "How do I join a match?",
 "faq2_a": "Go to the Matches tab, find a public match that fits your schedule, and tap \"Join\". You can join as an individual or with your team.",
 "faq3_q": "Can I cancel a booking?",
 "faq3_a": "Yes, cancellations are allowed up to 6 hours before kickoff for pitch bookings (and 2 days for tournaments) for a full refund. Cancellations within the first 20 minutes are eligible for a refund minus administrative processing fees.",
 "faq4_q": "How do I create a team?",
 "faq4_a": "In the Profile tab, select \"My Team\". From there, you can choose a name, logo, and invite your friends using their VSP ID.",
 "faq5_q": "What happens if a match is disputed?",
 "faq5_a": "If teams disagree on the result, a VSP moderator will review the match history and evidence to determine the final outcome.",
 "faq6_q": "How are stadium ratings calculated?",
 "faq6_a": "Ratings are an average of verified reviews left by players after their matches. Only players who actually played at the stadium can leave a review.",
 "faq7_q": "How do I edit my personal profile?",
 "faq7_a": "In the Profile tab, select 'Edit Profile'. From there, you can update your name, picture, preferred position, and phone number.",
 "faq8_q": "Why is my match not appearing in the public list?",
 "faq8_a": "Private matches are hidden. Ensure you select 'Public Match' during booking if you want others to find and join you.",
 "faq9_q": "How do I get a refund?",
 "faq9_a": "Upon valid cancellation, the amount is credited to your in-app wallet for future bookings.",
 "faq10_q": "How do I contact support?",
 "faq10_a": "Tap 'Chat with Support' on this screen to start a WhatsApp conversation with our team directly.",
